# Reference repositories (local only)

Copy to `.claude/reference-repos.local.md` and fill in the paths on your machine.
That file is gitignored: client repository names are database/local data, never
repo content (see the "Client data" rule in CLAUDE.md).

| Role | Local path |
| --- | --- |
| Quality tooling reference (Biome, Knip, Lefthook) | `/path/to/repo` |
| Blueprint annotation reference (`.claude/skills/blueprint/`) | `/path/to/repo` |
| Drizzle / Better Auth reference | `/path/to/repo` |
